:712,"width":530,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAYAAAAICAMAAADtGH4KAAAAKlBMVEUtKio1MDDY19siHyBUTUw+ODjh3+NMRUS8ubt1cXFpYWBeV1d/fH7Cv8JSxmMsAAAACXBIWXMAABYlAAAWJQFJUiTwAAAAMElEQVR4nAXBiQHAIAzEMF/+AN1/3UqYVdlgNVYf83b3chTpoqPjHjI6JUhAuDvwAx3WAON38Lf7AAAAAElFTkSuQmCC","blurWidth":6,"blurHeight":8},"alt":"Portrait of Alex Martinez","sizes":"(min-width: 1024px) 32rem, 20rem","className":"aspect-square rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 object-cover dark:bg-zinc-800","priority":true}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:order-first lg:row-span-2","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-zinc-100","children":"I build systems that need to work outside the demo."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-7 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","The only thing I’ve probably loved longer than solving technical problems is playing fútbol. If I’m not building something, there’s a good chance I’m on a field, clearing my head and resetting the same way good engineering work eventually forces you to do.",{"children":"The only thing I’ve probably loved longer than solving technical problems is playing fútbol. If I’m not building something, there’s a good chance I’m on a field, clearing my head and resetting the same way good engineering work eventually forces you to do."}],["$","p","I did not start in software with a neat master plan. I studied mechanical engineering with a focus on robotics because I kept getting pulled toward problems where hardware, software, and people all had to meet in the same system.",{"children":"I did not start in software with a neat master plan. I studied mechanical engineering with a focus on robotics because I kept getting pulled toward problems where hardware, software, and people all had to meet in the same system."}],["$","p","That led me from robotic arm tooling and computer vision projects in school to industrial automation, product development, and software that has to coordinate robots, data, and operators in production environments.",{"children":"That led me from robotic arm tooling and computer vision projects in school to industrial automation, product development, and software that has to coordinate robots, data, and operators in production environments."}],["$","p","Today I care less about building something that sounds impressive and more about building something that is coherent, maintainable, and useful to the people who rely on it.",{"children":"Today I care less about building something that sounds impressive and more about building something that is coherent, maintainable, and useful to the people who rely on it."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col items-start justify-center gap-10 lg:pl-20","children":[["$","ul",null,{"role":"list","children":[["$","li","https://x.com/alexmar19190",{"className":"flex","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"https://x.com/alexmar19190","className":"group flex text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 transition hover:text-orange-500 dark:text-zinc-200 dark:hover:text-orange-500","children":[["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","aria-hidden":"true","className":"h-6 w-6 flex-none fill-zinc-500 transition group-hover:fill-orange-500","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M13.3174 10.7749L19.1457 4H17.7646L12.7039 9.88256L8.66193 4H4L10.1122 12.8955L4 20H5.38119L10.7254 13.7878L14.994 20H19.656L13.3171 10.7749H13.3174ZM11.4257 12.9738L10.8064 12.0881L5.87886 5.03974H8.00029L11.9769 10.728L12.5962 11.6137L17.7652 19.0075H15.6438L11.4257 12.9742V12.9738Z"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"ml-4","children":"Follow on X"}]]}]}],["$","li","https://www.instagram.com/alexeygallegomartinez/",{"className":"mt-4 flex","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"https://www.instagram.com/alexeygallegomartinez/","className":"group flex text-sm font-medium text-zinc-800 transition hover:text-orange-500 dark:text-zinc-200 dark:hover:text-orange-50